{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/restore.png?t=1738860414\" />Work your way through the mine as Sam, in an attempt to find your missing father. You'll need to blow up barricades and find parts to restore power to the many machines within the mine in order to progress through.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/restorepower.gif?t=1738860414\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/quiet.png?t=1738860414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure not to make too much noise! Many miners have lost their lives to the being that haunts the mine. You'll need to use your wit in order not to provoke her from her burrows. She might even hear you breathing!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/dontmakesound.gif?t=1738860414\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/alive.png?t=1738860414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try not to dwell, get in, and get out. Don't become another lost soul in Jawbone Hollow!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/dontbevictim.gif?t=1738860414\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412800?t=1738860414","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412800?t=1738860414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/65c4ba8bab812cd40567fae8f1a1b92f6640d2ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738860414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/65c4ba8bab812cd40567fae8f1a1b92f6640d2ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738860414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent depictions of blood and human remains."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/restore.png?t=1738860414\" />Work your way through the mine as Sam, in an attempt to find your missing father. You'll need to blow up barricades and find parts to restore power to the many machines within the mine in order to progress through.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/restorepower.gif?t=1738860414\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/quiet.png?t=1738860414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure not to make too much noise! Many miners have lost their lives to the being that haunts the mine. You'll need to use your wit in order not to provoke her from her burrows. She might even hear you breathing!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/dontmakesound.gif?t=1738860414\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/alive.png?t=1738860414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try not to dwell, get in, and get out. Don't become another lost soul in Jawbone Hollow!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/dontbevictim.gif?t=1738860414\" /></p>","developers":["CrusherXE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/header.jpg?t=1738860414","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"b